novadock (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed icon flickering during magnification resize
  * Fixed auto-hide: dock now reliably reappears when mouse moves to screen edge
  * Fixed spurious leave events breaking auto-hide
  * Fixed global hotkeys: proper keybinder format conversion
  * Redesigned settings window with modern sidebar navigation
  * Replaced Ko-fi with PayPal (@noviktech133) in About tab
  * Added human-readable comments throughout codebase
  * Removed debug print statements from application startup
  * Improved input shape handling when dock is hidden
  * Added poll-based edge detection as fallback for auto-hide

 -- Kamil 'Novik' Nowicki <novik@noviktech.com>  Sun, 09 Feb 2026 18:00:00 +0000

novadock (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Global hotkey support using keybinder-3.0 library
  * Configure launcher hotkey to toggle application launcher
  * Configure up to 4 application hotkeys for pinned apps
  * Hotkey conflict detection
  * Launch or focus behavior for application hotkeys
  * Automatic workspace switching when focusing apps
  * Force Close option in dock context menu
  * Ko-fi donation button in About tab
  * Fixed touchpad gesture scrolling in launcher
  * Fixed dock positioning on multi-monitor setups
  * Fixed command-line flags (--launcher, --settings)
  * Fixed dock vibration/jittering on hover
  * Fixed launcher grid column count (now shows 7 by default)
  * Improved icon spacing that scales with resolution

 -- Kamil 'Novik' Nowicki <novik@noviktech.com>  Sun, 09 Feb 2026 12:00:00 +0000

